add_to_file_name.plain, line 1: Write "the file" before "shopping.txt" to add to that file.

    add "milk" to "shopping.txt"
                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Try this:
    add "milk" to the file "shopping.txt"
Why: "add" puts an item at the end of a list, or adds to a number. With "the file", it adds a line at the end of a file.

